@baseUrl = http://localhost:5169

### Check for an application update (Admin authentication cookie required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/system/update

### Bypass the 15-minute release cache
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/system/update?refresh=true

### Queue the latest release (Admin cookie and antiforgery header required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/system/update
RequestVerificationToken: {{antiforgeryToken}}

